&lt;!-- Application Areas --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: rgb(249, 250, 251); border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; color: #111827;&quot;&gt;Application Areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metallurgy and Steel:&lt;/strong&gt; Handling, stacking, and reclaiming raw materials and production by-products such as iron ore, coke, scrap steel, and slag.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; In thermal power plants and waste-to-energy plants, responsible for the extraction, transfer, and ash handling of coal and biomass fuels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building Materials Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Grabbing and conveying bulk building materials such as limestone, sand, gravel, and cement clinker.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ports and Logistics:&lt;/strong&gt; Rapid loading and unloading of bulk cargo such as coal, ore, and grain at docks and freight yards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mining and Raw Material Processing:&lt;/strong&gt; Loading, transferring, and stacking of ore and slag.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waste Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Used for grabbing, sorting, stacking, and feeding of municipal solid waste, industrial waste, and construction waste.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
