&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- Application Areas --&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f8f9fb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px; padding:28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin:0; padding-left:22px; font-size:16px; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.9;&quot; class=&quot; list-paddingleft-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#222;&quot;&gt;Metallurgy and Steel:&lt;/strong&gt;Handling, stacking, and reclaiming raw materials and production by-products such as iron ore, coke, scrap steel, and slag.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#222;&quot;&gt;Power Generation:&lt;/strong&gt;In thermal power plants and waste-to-energy plants, responsible for the extraction, transfer, and ash handling of coal and biomass fuels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#222;&quot;&gt;Building Materials Industry:&lt;/strong&gt;Grabbing and conveying bulk building materials such as limestone, sand, gravel, and cement clinker.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#222;&quot;&gt;Ports and Logistics:&lt;/strong&gt;Rapid loading and unloading of bulk cargo such as coal, ore, and grain at docks and freight yards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#222;&quot;&gt;Mining and Raw Material Processing:&lt;/strong&gt;Loading, transferring, and stacking of ore and slag.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#222;&quot;&gt;Waste Management:&lt;/strong&gt;Used for grabbing, sorting, stacking, and feeding of municipal solid waste, industrial waste, and construction waste.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
